	(text "USB-A power: TPS2553 with RILIM ≈ 28.7kΩ target (~0.9A nominal); FAULT_N reports overcurrent/reverse-voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 160 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005205")
	)
	(text "USB-C power: TPS25821; CHG defaults LOW = USB standard current advertisement; Pico-B may later allow 1.5A only when budget permits."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 166 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005206")
	)
	(text "TPS25821 only applies VBUS after a valid sink attach. Source↔source is not a valid Type-C connection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 172 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005207")
	)
	(text "USB-C REF = 100kΩ 0.5% to GND; ≥120µF near IN and <10µF near connector OUT/VBUS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 178 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005208")
	)
	(text "All four D+/D− pairs get TPD2EUSB30A-class low-capacitance ESD close to receptacles."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 184 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005209")
	)
	(text "Push-push SPDT directly drives TS3USB221A S: A position selects 1D; C position selects 2D. Firmware is not in the data-selection path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 190 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005210")
	)
	(text "Hard-disable jumpers: OPEN=RUN; SHORT=OFF. A small LVC logic stage asserts mux OE when the selected physical receptacle is disabled."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 196 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88)
				(bold yes))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005211")
	)
	(text "Required OE logic: OE = !BOARD_ENABLE OR (!SEL & DIS_A) OR (SEL & DIS_C). Exact tiny gate/mux implementation is next-pass TBD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 202 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005212")
	)
	(text "LEDs are driven by TCA9535 through 1kΩ resistors so Pico-B can show solid active state or flash faults; LED colors remain population choices."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 208 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 0.88 0.88))
		)
		(uuid "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000005213")
	)
	(text "USB-A inactive-port charging is safe 5V power, but no fast-charge/BC1.2 promise yet. Optional BC1.2 support can be added only if cost/space justify it."
